# ── Signing material ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Never commit these. billzap.keystore was tracked in this public repo
# until 2026-10-06; the upload key has been reset with Google since.
# Removing a file from tracking does NOT remove it from history, which
# is why the reset is the fix and this is only hygiene.
#
# CI gets the keystore from the KEYSTORE_BASE64 secret and writes it to
# android/app/upload-keystore.jks at build time — nothing here is
# needed for a release build.
*.keystore
*.jks
key.properties
upload_certificate.pem
